Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "You think that shutting your gates and hiding in
your castle will keep you safe? How adorable...",
  "1.0.1.0" => "If I crush the hero and the princess, then the
completed Triforce will be mine for the taking!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "This castle is Hyrule's last line of defense.
If it falls, so too will our hope!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "We must capture Ganondorf's base if we
want to stand any chance of victory!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "I'll force open the gate and secure
a route for our advance.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "The gate is under attack! Command your
troops to subdue Zant first!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Immediately, Your Highness!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "The Hyrulean princess has already figured out
our plan! We must not underestimate her...",
  "1.0.8.0" => "These humans seem quite enthusiastic,
wouldn't you say?",
  "1.0.9.0" => "They won't quell our ambitions, no matter
how hard they try!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Ganondorf, you can't win! We have the
legendary hero on our side, right, Link?",
  "1.0.11.0" => "The hero... I've outlived more "heroes"
than you could imagine!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Link! Do not wear yourself thin! Pull back
and reserve your strength!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "So you put all your faith in this hero and then
worry he'll get hurt? How touching...and pitiful.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Don't worry, everyone! Link will be back!
He just has to heal up a bit first!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Our mission has been accomplished!
The way is open!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "We've downed one of their strongest warriors!
Let's ride this momentum and attack!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "You think my resolve will waver in the slightest
with Zant's defeat? Then you are delusional.",
  "1.0.18.0" => "With the Great Fairy's assistance,
we can win this battle!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Don't let her get to the fountain! If she gets
ahold of that Great Fairy, we'll regret it!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Allow me to put an end to their fantasies
of victory.",
  "1.0.21.0" => "We're getting nowhere... Leave Ghirahim for
now! Make the fountain your top priority!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Ghirahim is down! We've done it!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "I'll make those weaklings regret their
arrogance!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "If we pool our magic power, the Enemy
Base will fall.",
  "1.0.25.0" => "We need more time to gather enough magic
power...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "That's it! We need just a little more!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Yes! We have all the magic we need.
It is time.",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Ha... Too bad.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Impa...! It is unbelievable...",
  "1.0.30.0" => "C'mon, Link! We have to win this fight!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Link has returned--we have a window of
opportunity! Our forces must strike at once!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Link, let's join the attack!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "How kind of the hero and the princess to come
right to me... It makes my task much simpler!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Stop their advance! We need to protect
Princess Zelda at all costs!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Allow me to stop the child.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Leave the princess to me.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "No... We cannot accept defeat...",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Destroy the hero next!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "L-Link! Wake up!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Is that all? I expected the hero to be
something more than a minor diversion.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Take out the princess next!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Link is risking his life... I refuse to sit
and do nothing!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "The princess is giving it all she's got.
Link! We have to fight too!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Stubborn fools... It looks like this won't
end unless I defeat them both...",
  "1.0.45.0" => "N-no... I will destroy you even if it kills
me!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "I'm sorry, but you're in no condition to
make such threats. Ha ha ha!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Link, don't give up!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "It doesn't matter how many times you
come at me! I can't be defeated by YOU!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "I will not let Link fall... Link, I'm coming
to help!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Link, let's go! We've got to rescue the
princess!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "If I use the power of the Triforce residing in
me, I can cleanse the evil from this keep!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "We haven't a moment to lose. I have to
head to Ganondorf's base!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Link, use the Triforce of Courage to wipe
out the Dark Power in that keep!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "There's no point in putting it off any
longer! Let's take out the Enemy Base!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "We will secure our victory if we can just
capture the Enemy Base!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "I shall use the power of the Triforce to
drive the evil spirit from this keep!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Link, this is the Enemy Base! If we take
that, the battle is ours!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Link, use the Triforce to extinguish the
Dark Power!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Guh... THAT'S what the Triforce can do?!
We have to stop it somehow!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "The base will fall if we don't do something...
Destroy them NOW! NO prisoners! NO mercy!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "I won't let these monsters bring shame to
our forces!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "We're not going to let you take Hyrule
from us!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "What are you doing?! Protect the base!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Finally... I have all three pieces of the
Triforce at my command!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Troublesome fools... I have no choice but
to postpone my vision for this land...",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Things are not going well...
I must do something!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "I shall press on too!
All troops--move to attack!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Don't cower, men! We have to push the
enemy back!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Allow me to crush these ants.",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Aha! And now the enemies in the north are
truly separated!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "They're running scared! Let's take the fight
directly to the Enemy Base!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Where did such confidence come from?
Dispose of them! Crush their spirits!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Why are humans always so eager to die...?",
  "13.0.1.0" => "That boy... If I can eliminate him, perhaps
the goody-goodies will cry like weaklings...",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Link isn't done yet! Just you wait until his
wounds are healed--then you'll have a fight!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Only my will shall be done today... Don't
allow the enemy anywhere near the fountain!",
}